function.body:
v_c_location_id character varying; BEGIN -- ETP-5060: return the Location ID, NOT a pre-rendered address string. -- -- A computed column is raw SQL inside the query (Hibernate formula): it has no -- access to the request language, so any text it builds is frozen in the base -- language. That is why the country used to read "Spain" in a Spanish session: -- this function called ad_column_identifier_std, the variant WITHOUT a language -- parameter, and passing one in is not possible from here. -- -- Returning the id moves the rendering to read time: the column reference -- (Search -> Location) resolves the identifier through the DAL, which goes -- through C_Country_Trl and answers in the session language. An id is stable -- and language-independent, so materializing it freezes no translation. -- -- TOTAL FUNCTION. Refresh_Mode = 'S' runs this inside the business transaction, -- so ANY exception raised here rolls back the C_BPartner save itself. Every edge -- case below must resolve to a value -- NULL is a legitimate one, an empty address -- column -- and never to an error.
-- Edge case 1 - null target id. The engine always passes a PK, but a NULL argument -- must answer "no address" rather than reach the query. IF p_bpartner_id IS NULL THEN RETURN NULL; END IF;
-- Edge case 2 - zero rows (a partner with no active address). Plain SELECT ... INTO -- assigns NULL and does NOT raise, unlike SELECT ... INTO STRICT (deliberately not -- used here, it would raise NO_DATA_FOUND). -- Edge case 3 - several rows, including several created in the same instant. LIMIT 1 -- makes the result single-valued, so TOO_MANY_ROWS cannot be raised. The ordering is -- fully deterministic (the priority case, then created, then the PK as tie-break) -- because the engine writes the value unconditionally on every recompute: an -- arbitrary pick would make two recomputes of unchanged data store different ids and -- ad_scd_check would report permanent phantom drift. select bploc.c_location_id into v_c_location_id from c_bpartner_location bploc where bploc.c_bpartner_id = p_bpartner_id and bploc.isactive = 'Y' order by case when bploc.isbillto = 'Y' then 1 when bploc.isshipto = 'Y' then 2 else 3 end, bploc.created desc, bploc.c_bpartner_location_id desc limit 1;
return v_c_location_id;
-- Belt and braces. Nothing above should be able to raise, but an unforeseen runtime error -- must not take the partner save down with it. An empty address is visible and -- recoverable; a save that cannot complete is not. EXCEPTION WHEN OTHERS THEN RETURN NULL; END ETGO_GET_LOCATION
